Writes inspectable main.tf.json and deployment instructions

Usage: leptoskit infra generate [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --app-target <NAME>  Select a named target from the root leptoskit.toml
      --force              Replace an edited generated configuration
  -h, --help               Print help
  -V, --version            Print version
